<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 30.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 30.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:    April 30    April 29   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  274.600     274.400     247.020   11.17 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  310.200     309.400     306.830    1.10 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.900     158.425     158.970   -0.04 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.144	47.008	47.182   -0.08 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  447.340     445.140     419.180    6.72 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.270     140.925     141.685   -0.29 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.032	15.984	16.185   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  216.860     216.610     212.430    2.09 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.882	 1.882	 1.888   -0.32 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.581	 1.582	 1.581    0.00 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  186.830     186.325     183.135    2.02 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
